  "description": "Isolated in-air racetrack-shaped approximately one-wavelength loop for 2.45 GHz baseline study. PEC round conductor 4 mm diameter; outer dimensions 50.7538 mm tall by 29.2776 mm wide (matching prior measured loop aspect ratio); centerline closed-track perimeter 122.3643 mm before removing feed gap. Right-hand straight section is split; wire centerline ends are 8 mm apart and the nominal metal-to-metal air gap is 4 mm (assuming 2 mm wire radius). 50-ohm differential lumped feed, no balun, reflector, directors, ground or boom. Initial 2 mm uniform mesh is exploratory: converge with finer mesh before treating resonance, S11 or efficiency as reliable. The entire loop is translated by -0.638819 mm in X so the zero-width Z-directed feed lies on the 2 mm uniform Yee grid (X=12 mm, Y=0).",
